# Generated by Cargo
debug
target

# Rust backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC debug info
*.pdb

# Mutation testing
**/mutants.out*/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
*.egg
dist/
*.whl
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Macrame runtime (generated, never committed)
.codegraph/
.codegraph/
*.db
# Siblings of the store file: the single-writer lock, and SQLite's WAL pair.
# Spelled out rather than `*.lock`, which would swallow Cargo.lock and uv.lock.
*.db.lock
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Harness runtime (generated, never committed)
.harness/spill/
.harness/backups/
.harness/*.db
.harness/*.bin
.harness/wal.log
.harness/metrics.json
.harness/codegraph.sock

# Run logs
*.log

# Scratch files: hand-off notes (.tmp-okf-thought-p6a.txt was committed by
# accident) and an extension renamed aside while a server holds it loaded.
.tmp-*
*.pyd.old-*

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.coderadar/
